Najena is the ancient home of a twisted dark elf magician named Najena, who carved out this hole in the hidden areas of the Lavastorm Mountains in which to carry out her experiments, as well as those of her allies. The undead walk the halls as if it is home. [[Key_Compendium|Various keys]] are used throughout this zone.  Respawn is 19 minutes for most mobs.

